    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Docker / cAdvisor – Slim (Homelab)\n\nThis dashboard shows **Docker containers running inside a Proxmox LXC**, using **cAdvisor cgroup metrics**.\n\n### Important notes\n- A \"container\" here is a **systemd cgroup** (`docker-<id>.scope`)\n- Container identity is based on the **`id` label**, not on `container` or `name`\n- Only Docker containers are shown (`id =~ .*docker-.*`)\n- Host / LXC metrics are **intentionally excluded**\n\n### How to interpret values\n- **Active containers** ≠ total seen containers\n- **Seen containers** includes recently stopped containers (Prometheus series)\n- Short time windows are used to approximate *real activity*\n\nDesigned to stay **lightweight, reproducible and SRE-friendly**.\n"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Legend: Containers overview",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Containers overview\n\n- **Docker containers active (last 2m)**  \n  Containers that produced CPU activity in the last 2 minutes.  \n  Closest approximation to *containers running now*.\n\n- **Docker containers seen (series)**  \n  Number of container series currently stored in Prometheus.  \n  Includes recently stopped containers.\n\n- **Docker container churn (15m)**  \n  Containers that appeared or changed in the last 15 minutes.  \n  High values may indicate crash-loops or frequent redeployments.\n\n- **cAdvisor up**  \n  Health check for the cAdvisor exporter on this instance.\n"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Legend: Services view",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Services view (human-friendly)\n\nYour cAdvisor metrics include a `service` label (example: `service=\"infra-grafana\"`).  \nThis section aggregates metrics **by service** (instead of raw `id`), so you can quickly spot *which service* is heavy.\n\nUse the **Service** dropdown to filter, then drill down in the `id` panels below.\n"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
