    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Legend: CPU & throttling",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### CPU & throttling\n\n- **CPU (cores)**  \n  Real CPU usage per container, expressed in **CPU cores**.  \n  Values > 1 mean the container is using multiple cores.\n\n- **CPU throttling %**  \n  Percentage of time the container was throttled by the CPU scheduler.  \n  Sustained values > 20% usually indicate **CPU limits too low**.\n"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
