        "content": "### Memory\n\n- **Memory working set**  \n  Memory actively used by the container (best signal for pressure).\n\n- **Memory % of limit**  \n  Working set divided by the configured memory limit.  \n  Values > 90% mean the container is close to OOM conditions.\n\nIf no memory limit is configured, percentages may be misleading.\n"
