        "y": 61,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Network\n\n- **RX / TX bytes per second**  \n  Network throughput per container.\n\nTop values usually correspond to:\n- reverse proxies\n- APIs\n- databases\n- metrics/log pipelines\n"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
