      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Missing containers\n\nThis table shows containers that **stopped sending metrics**.\n\n- **seconds_since_last_seen**  \n  Time elapsed since the container last produced metrics.\n\nValues > 300 seconds usually mean:\n- the container stopped\n- the container was recreated\n- Docker / cAdvisor restarted\n"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Docker containers missing (seconds since last seen)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 77,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 10
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
